## 3. Structure, Visual Callouts & Executive Blocks

- **Executive Takeaways:** Always provide a high-level summary at the start of chapters using blockquotes:
  ```markdown
  > ***Executive Takeaway:***  
  > [Summary of volume, baseline defect rate, financial cost, operational blind spots, and verified savings/impact]
  ```
- **Business & Financial Insights:** Pair charts and key tables with actionable takeaway callouts:
  ```markdown
  > ***Business Insight Gambar X.X:***  
  > [1-2 sentences explaining what the visual trend implies for operations]
  
  > ***Key Financial Insight Tabel X.X:***  
  > 1. [Key point 1]
  > 2. [Key point 2]
  ```
- **Figure & Table Captions:** Always cite verified sources beneath visual assets:
  ```markdown
  *Gambar X.X: Deskripsi Visual (Sumber: SAP ZPPRSIPPC0012 / QC Verifikasi)*
  ```

---

## 4. Data Integrity & Mathematical Transparency

- **Strict 4-Attribute Data Standards:** Every metric and number must include:
  1. **Value / Number (Nilai):** e.g., `177.636.930`, `4,61%`, `Rp 2,23 Miliar`
  2. **Unit (Satuan):** e.g., `Lembar Cetak`, `pp`, `Rupiah`, `Jam / Mesin`
  3. **Period (Periode):** e.g., `Jan – Mar 2025`, `Semester 1 2026`
  4. **Verified Source (Sumber Data):** e.g., SAP T-Code `ZPPRSIPPC0012`, Modul Verifikasi Mutu
- **Mathematical Transparency (LaTeX Block):** Format calculations using step-by-step LaTeX equations (e.g., standard tambah cetak @ Rp 3.000/lembar):
  ```markdown
  $$\begin{aligned}
  \text{Volume Produksi Tahunan} &= 177.636.930 \text{ Lembar Cetak} \\
  \text{Lembar Rusak Baseline (4,61\%)} &= 177.636.930 \times 4,61\% = \mathbf{8.189.062 \text{ Lembar}} \\
  \text{Nilai Kerugian Finansial} &= 8.189.062 \times \text{Rp } 3.000 = \mathbf{\text{Rp } 24.567.186.000 \text{ / Tahun}}
  \end{aligned}$$
  ```

