## 5. Domain Terminology & Frameworks

- **Inschiet:** Kerusakan cetak / defect rate.
- **HCS / HCTS:** Hasil Cetak Sempurna / Hasil Cetak Tidak Sempurna.
- **PCHT / MMEA:** Pita Cukai Hasil Tembakau / Minuman Mengandung Etil Alkohol.
- **Evolutionary Context:** Reference SIRINE 3.5 (2024) as solving *what defect category occurred*, and DSS SIRINE 4.0 (2026) as solving *which machine, which shift, and what prescriptive maintenance action to execute*.
- **5-Pillar Cost of Inaction:** Evaluate risks across Cost, Quality, Compliance, Safety & ESG, and Service SLA.
